    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements mass-based dynamics for growth rate of organisms. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_growth_rate_dynamics" kindref="compound">GrowthRateDynamics</ref> is a subclass of <ref refid="class_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">MassBasedDynamics</ref> and calculates the growth rate based on environmental conditions, including temperature, moisture, and relative humidity. The implementation follows the model described in Savage et al. 2004, Fig. 4B. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
